Z||000014||RedGTFieroKCMO||12-08-2001||08:23 PM||||Thank you to everyone for the comments!! I appreciate them. Beleive me, the paint is NOT that good. I bought it sight unseen. Lots of web cracks and overspray, and some underspray. (not enough paint).<P>Since this is a 85 GT converted to a fastback, I noticed tonight that the amber turn signals are not being used at all and the red brake lights dont function properly. What is needed to fix this when a conversion is done????? Thanks!!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>P.S. It's got a rebuilt V-6 Auto and some kind of computer chip for performance. It really hauls......  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by RedGTFieroKCMO (edited 12-08-2001).]||||reg||14
